{
  "session_id": "d02",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "关于论文《Mapping Languages and Demographics with Georeferenced Corpora》，Do they authors offer a hypothesis for why Twitter data makes better predictions about the inventory of languages used in each country?",
      "turn_id": "d02-t1"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": {
        "decision": "refuse",
        "claims": [],
        "text": "当前语料证据不足或请求超出论文库范围。"
      },
      "turn_id": "d02-t1"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "请解释刚才那篇论文对于这个问题的证据，保留引用；不能从常识补充结论。",
      "turn_id": "d02-t2"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": {
        "claims": [
          {
            "key": "twitter_better_inventory",
            "text": "论文发现 Twitter 数据对国家层面语言清单的预测优于网络爬取数据。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "2004.00809",
                "chunk_id": "c-204aa49abd2af324ac170d44"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "fewer_missing_languages",
            "text": "在有地面真值语言使用数据的情况下，部分国家的语料未覆盖当地人口使用的所有语言；在这种情况下 Twitter 缺失的语言更少。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "2004.00809",
                "chunk_id": "c-9887004ca215701b79e8e570"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "fewer_false_negatives_region",
            "text": "Twitter 对北美和大洋洲的语言使用情况提供了更好的表示。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "2004.00809",
                "chunk_id": "c-01b9a363a68a29a0e9af4ff8"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "few_false_positives",
            "text": "总体来说这些语料假阳性很少，但 Twitter 数据中的假阳性更多；Twitter 在美国、加拿大、南非、法国、印度和澳大利亚存在过度预测的语言。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "2004.00809",
                "chunk_id": "c-9887004ca215701b79e8e570"
              },
              {
                "paper_id": "2004.00809",
                "chunk_id": "c-01b9a363a68a29a0e9af4ff8"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "wealth_bias_hypothesis",
            "text": "作者提出一种解释：Twitter 数据在按 GDP 加权的人口上匹配更好、按互联网使用统计加权时匹配更差，这暗示 Twitter 平台所代表的人群比一般网络爬取数据更富裕。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "2004.00809",
                "chunk_id": "c-9887004ca215701b79e8e570"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "urban_bias_hypothesis",
            "text": "作者还提出另一种解释：本文的 Twitter 采集基于城市地区，而城市地区往往更富裕。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "2004.00809",
                "chunk_id": "c-9887004ca215701b79e8e570"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "geo_collection_no_language_bias",
            "text": "Twitter 数据通过空间检索采集每个城市 50 公里半径内的推文，避免使用特定语言的关键词或话题标签造成选择偏差。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "2004.00809",
                "chunk_id": "c-227fd89576f8c0e3eb0ce352"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "georef_gdp_confound",
            "text": "Twitter 数据集依赖地理定位推文，而并非所有用户都有 GPS 设备；作者推测人均 GDP 较低的国家地理定位推文比例可能更低，推文总量也更少。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "2004.00809",
                "chunk_id": "c-227fd89576f8c0e3eb0ce352"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "common_languages_effect",
            "text": "英语和西班牙语在 Twitter 上非常常见，因此以这两种语言为主的国家默认就会有较好的表示。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "2004.00809",
                "chunk_id": "c-01b9a363a68a29a0e9af4ff8"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "unresolved_false_positive_sources",
            "text": "对于俄罗斯的假阳性，作者指出仍需更多研究来区分移民、旅游和商业等假阳性语言出现在数字数据集中的不同来源。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "2004.00809",
                "chunk_id": "c-01b9a363a68a29a0e9af4ff8"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "decision": "answer"
      },
      "turn_id": "d02-t2"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "与《Unsupervised Question Answering for Fact-Checking》对比，分别说明两篇论文如何回答“Do they authors offer a hypothesis for why Twitter data makes better predictions about the inventory of languages used in each country?”与“How large is the FEVER dataset?”，并说明是否具有可比性。",
      "turn_id": "d02-t3"
